nd age distribution of the population in the 2000 U.S. Census.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted to represent the communities surveyed, and SUDAAN was used to account for the complex survey and sample design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Adjusted for sax and age.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}